# Copy the variables required by the concrete project into this file.
# Never put tokens, passwords or raw credential contents here.
# Prefer *_FILE variables that point to a protected file outside Git.

# PROJECT_ENV=development
# PROJECT_CREDENTIAL_FILE=/protected/path/credential

# Reference checks (.agents/scripts/check-reference-*.py) read only these keys
# from the ignored .env file. The contact address joins the metadata services'
# polite pools; the API keys are optional. Write real values only in .env.
# BIBTEX_CHECK_MAILTO=you@example.org
# OPENALEX_API_KEY=
# S2_API_KEY=
